  "description": ".NET 8 client for the Ensemble peer-to-peer messaging daemon. Typed wrappers over the gRPC API: identity, status, contacts, peer dial, service registration with chat / RPC transports, the launched-client attach relay (both halves — frontend attach and the backend operator-message surface), file offers, declarable slash-commands, peer introductions, payload-limit and rate-limit awareness as typed exceptions.",
